   "source": [
    "## 📖 Phase 1 Feature: Intelligent Manifest-Based Ingestion\n",
    "\n",
    "**What is `USE_MANIFEST`?**\n",
    "\n",
    "`USE_MANIFEST` is a toggle switch that controls which ingestion method is used:\n",
    "\n",
    "### USE_MANIFEST = True (Phase 1 - Recommended) 🆕\n",
    "- **Smart Deduplication**: Tracks every document with SHA256 hashing\n",
    "- **Incremental Updates**: Only processes genuinely new documents\n",
    "- **Portfolio Intelligence**: Detects when you add/remove tickers\n",
    "- **Performance**: 5-20x faster on re-runs (80-95% deduplication rate)\n",
    "\n",
    "**How it works**:\n",
    "```\n",
    "First run:  Processes 100 documents → Builds graph\n",
    "Second run: Skips 95 duplicates, processes 5 new → Updates graph\n",
    "Result:     95% faster! ⚡\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "### USE_MANIFEST = False (Legacy)\n",
    "- **Full Re-ingestion**: Processes everything from scratch\n",
    "- **No Deduplication**: Same documents re-processed every time\n",
    "- **Use for**: A/B testing, troubleshooting, baseline comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 📊 Performance Comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "| Feature | Manifest Mode (True) | Legacy Mode (False) |\n",
    "|---------|---------------------|---------------------|\n",
    "| **1st Run Speed** | Normal | Normal |\n",
    "| **2nd Run Speed** | 5-20x faster ⚡ | Same speed |\n",
    "| **Duplicates** | Prevented ✅ | Re-processed ❌ |\n",
    "| **Portfolio changes** | Smart (delta only) | Full re-fetch |\n",
    "| **Recommended for** | Production, daily updates | Testing, comparison |\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🎬 Real Example\n",
    "\n",
    "**Scenario**: You run the notebook, then add AAPL to portfolio the next day\n",
    "\n",
    "**With Manifest Mode (True)**:\n",
    "- Day 1: Process [NVDA, TSMC, AMD] → 100 documents\n",
    "- Day 2: Add AAPL\n",
    "  - ✅ Detect: \"AAPL is new!\"\n",
    "  - ✅ Fetch: Only AAPL data (10 documents)\n",
    "  - ✅ Skip: 100 existing documents\n",
    "  - **Result**: 90% less API calls, 10x faster\n",
    "\n",
    "**With Legacy Mode (False)**:\n",
    "- Day 1: Process [NVDA, TSMC, AMD] → 100 documents  \n",
    "- Day 2: Add AAPL\n",
    "  - ❌ Fetch: All 4 tickers (110 documents)\n",
    "  - ❌ Process: Everything from scratch\n",
    "  - **Result**: Wasted 100 API calls, same speed\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 💡 When to Use Each Mode\n",
    "\n",
    "**Use `USE_MANIFEST=True` (Recommended)**:\n",
    "- ✅ Incremental updates (daily/weekly runs)\n",
    "- ✅ Portfolio changes (add/remove tickers)\n",
    "- ✅ Production use\n",
    "- ✅ Want faster re-runs\n",
    "\n",
    "**Use `USE_MANIFEST=False`**:\n",
    "- ✅ First time testing the system\n",
    "- ✅ A/B comparison with legacy method\n",
    "- ✅ Troubleshooting manifest issues\n",
    "- ✅ Want complete rebuild from scratch\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "### 🔍 What You'll See\n",
    "\n",
    "**Manifest Mode Output**:\n",
    "```\n",
    "🆕 Using manifest-based ingestion (Phase 1)\n",
    "   ✓ Deduplication enabled\n",
    "   ✓ Incremental updates\n",
    "\n",
    "📋 Deduplication Stats:\n",
    "   New documents: 5\n",
    "   Skipped (duplicates): 95\n",
    "   Deduplication rate: 95.0%\n",
    "\n",
    "➕ New tickers added: AAPL\n",
    "✓ Existing tickers: 3 unchanged\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Manifest File**: `.ingestion_manifest.json` created in storage directory\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Default**: Set to `True` for best performance"
   ]
  },
